    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "On Sesame Street,where the cookies crumble,",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3,
      "endFrame": 109
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Cookie Monster sings,his voice a humble",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 112,
      "endFrame": 232
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Five-note wonder,a simple song,",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 235,
      "endFrame": 356
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Where cookies and melodies belong.",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 359,
      "endFrame": 472
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "\"C is for cookie,\" that's good enough for me,",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 475,
      "endFrame": 595
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Five little notes in a cookie melody.",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 598,
      "endFrame": 718
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "A monster's voice,deep and true,",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 721,
      "endFrame": 841
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Singing the blues,'bout cookies too.",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 844,
      "endFrame": 950
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "No ballads here,just crunchy treats,",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 953,
      "endFrame": 1073
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "On the stage,he feels the beats.",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1076,
      "endFrame": 1197
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Grover might join,a duet they'd try,",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1200,
      "endFrame": 1319
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Sounds like a cookie-filled battle cry.",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1322,
      "endFrame": 1428
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Bill Sherman laughs,says it's quite a show,",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1431,
      "endFrame": 1551
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "With growls and gargles,the tunes they flow.",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1554,
      "endFrame": 1674
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "\"Arrggh\" they sing,not always on key,",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1677,
      "endFrame": 1783
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "But in Cookie's world,it's perfect harmony.",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1786,
      "endFrame": 1906
    },
    {
